  "reflectionText": "Philip went down to the city of Samaria and proclaimed Christ. Unclean spirits came out. The paralyzed and the lame were healed. There was great joy in that city. What is it for the gospel to arrive in a city the apostles had not yet reached, in the hands of a man who had been chosen to wait on tables?"
